  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Late edition — ARC-AGI-3\nAFF AI CLUB climbs twenty places to ninth at 38.98. Yi-Chia Chen holds first at 62.96, ahead of Tufa Labs at 56.52. The last dance is fifth; Son & Mark & Ronen rises to seventh. The provisional gold cutoff climbs to 36.89, leaving Lord Han Solo only 0.09 points above it. Public standings do not settle private medals.\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-11-evening-arc-3",
